ZIGMon ESP32 Gateway firmware
=============================

The Yeelock module (esp32/ZigmonGateway/mod_yeelock.cpp, yeelock_proto.*, yeelock_codes.*,
yeelock_cloud.*) implements protocol knowledge derived from:

  * yeehack by aso824 - https://github.com/aso824/yeehack
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
    (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
    Used as reference: the BLE packet layout (packet.py), the notification codes
    (connection.py), the GATT characteristics, and the Yeelock cloud endpoints, OAuth client
    and fields (fetch.py). No Python code was copied; the firmware is an independent C++
    implementation.

  * yeelock by cnrd - https://github.com/cnrd/yeelock
    The original reverse engineering of the Yeelock BLE protocol.

The Yeelock protocol is unofficial. "Yeelock" and "Xiaomi" are trademarks of their owners;
this project is not affiliated with them.

esp32/tests/vendor/mini_sha.h (used only by the native unit tests) was written for this
project and is released into the public domain (CC0).
